                "description": "Omnia 905/00 Solid Brass Door Lever - This Omnia made solid brass door handle is basic enough in its design to beautifully integrate into any décor; but what is most appealing about this handle is that it’s timeless. Instead of just another plain doorknob, this fashionable leverset can just as easily hearken back to images of vintage homes, as it can meld into modern-day minimalism, or exude its charming sci-fi qualities—all while adding just the right amount of interesting detail to your doors.",
